WEBVTT

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.080
I'm at sea.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.330
Wait, why?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.060
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.060
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.560
I decided this myself

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.560
I decided that relying on chance

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:50.070
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:55.030
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.950
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.880
The future is opening up to me like a vast river

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.170
Even if sailing straight is difficult,

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.510
I will hold my head high

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:17.180
I'll change my life,

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:20.220
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:26.060
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.980
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.700
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:56.550
What am I doing here?

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.260
Good morning, Yura.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.810
Bask on an isolated island

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.810
to rise like a burning phoenix.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.810
Bask on an isolated island

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:08.200
Did you forget our
big friendly today?

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.160
Right!

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.570
I overslept!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.240
You were so excited, you stayed up late preparing.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:19.770
You wouldn't wake up when it was time to leave,

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.340
so we just hauled you on board.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.890
I'm so sorry!

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:26.800
Don't sweat it.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.910
Look at that instead.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.200
Our friendly will be on that island.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.590
And those people...

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.170
are our opponents.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.840
Pedal to the metal!

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.260
Man, they sure overtook us.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.760
Serves us city slickers right.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:48.660
We're gonna storm the beach in three minutes.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.270
Prepare for battle!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.590
Roger!

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:54.460
Let's go, C3 Club!

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.540
Let's have fun...

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.780
and win!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.850
Hit!

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.710
<i>I swore to never run away.</i>

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:57.750
<i>I won't go back...</i>

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.950
to my old self!

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.470
Are you okay?

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.290
I'm fine.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.030
I can do this.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.020
Only Karira and Rento are left.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.000
All right.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.880
Let's back them up!

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:27.370
Roger!

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.550
<i>We'll help you, girls!</i>

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.250
Whoops!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.280
<i>When you attack out of cover,</i>

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.140
<i>never pop up above the top.</i>

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.590
<i>Fire from the side!</i>

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:49.010
Hit!

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.100
Hit!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.350
You saved my life there!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:55.850
Three left!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.440
<i>I have to be faster.</i>

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.400
<i>I have to be better!</i>

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.780
Hit!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.030
Ya hit me.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.530
Good job, Yura!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:11.660
Careful!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.300
Hit...

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.760
We won!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.510
Yura, blow this!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.060
It's the victory whistle!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:31.310
Blow so hard the whole island hears it!

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.500
Are you steaksies done?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.760
Awesome!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.350
That...

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.510
That was mine!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.990
Team Seto's here fer some cultural exchange!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.690
Team Seto?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.570
Momoka

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.570
We all got Seto as our family name, see?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.950
Our bonds're thicker 'n water!

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:31.410
My food!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.790
Hey, she's the Speed Demon of the West.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.280
Darn right!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.960
Ain't you a scrawny one?

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.210
Put some meat on them bones!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.680
Well, I was going to...

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:46.000
They had a bad day, but they're one of the best airsoft teams in Kansai.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.300
How about'cha catch 'em somethin'?

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:51.340
Righto!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.710
Hold on a sec.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.420
I can't eat that!

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.120
You want it sliced?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.910
No, please!

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.300
Let it go!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.880
They ain't that easy to catch, ya know!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:23.790
How 'bout octopus balls?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.800
I say we hold an octopus ball eating contest!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.860
Ooh, I'm in!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:34.190
Hey, don't overeat!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:36.800
On your marks...

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.700
Go!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.320
So not cool!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.510
Man, Yura,

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.650
you got three hits out there! You were on fire!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.320
You've changed so much.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.860
Oh, I didn't...

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.870
G-Good night!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.720
Huh?

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.950
You on the way to the toilet too?

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.730
No, not really.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:30.960
You did great today, Yura.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.720
Thank you!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.570
<i>Let's win again tomorrow!</i>

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.210
I have high hopes for you, Yura.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.150
Roger!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.950
Huh?

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.110
Aim without aiming.

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:28.990
Roger!

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:31.980
I'm doing it, but...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.110
B-But why?!

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.370
N-No!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.110
It's over?

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.690
I was a fool for believing in you.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.390
No...

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.770
Don't go!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.520
Wait!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:25.780
<i>How pessimistic can I get?</i>

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.360
<i>But I'm a different person now!</i>

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.070
Ouch!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:38.050
Looks like someone's motivated.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.180
I-I am!

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.550
I'll do my best!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.550
Well, that's weird.

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:57.260
Are you looking for something?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.150
Sorta... I can't find the flag.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.550
Did you see it around?

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:03.660
Hmm...

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.410
Can't say I have.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.700
Lord, we thank you for nothing...

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.700
'cause we brought it all ourselves!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.710
I love hot dogs!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.540
The soup's great, too!

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:22.260
I warmed up the bread and grilled the wieners over charcoal.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:26.180
The soup is just consommé cooked together with leftover vegetables from yesterday, though.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.640
Marry me, Honoka!

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.650
I'll wear the pants, though.

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:38.100
Right, Sono.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:40.920
We can't find the flag anywhere.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.650
Have you seen it?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.460
Don't worry about that.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.570
I've arranged a replacement.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:47.710
A replacement?

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.950
T-That looks like my swimsuit!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:02.300
Kari's is there too.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:06.670
Why are our swimsuits serving as the flag?

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:07.470
One more thing!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.440
Is this your idea of a joke?!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:16.770
Well, Honoka's is on the big side, and yours stands out, so they were perfect fits.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.980
Yer poor flag wound up bein' kindle fer the fire under the troughs.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.580
No problem, it's part of the experience.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.860
It <i>is</i> a problem!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.220
Where's your flag?

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.490
At least give us yours!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:33.750
Well, ours got crispy fried, too.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.390
Well, what's done is done,

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.640
and since we can't have a normal match of Capture-The-Flag,

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.260
we're changing the rules to Center Flag instead.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:44.260
You know the rules, right, Yura?

00:13:44.660 --> 00:14:07.180
Today's

00:13:44.660 --> 00:14:07.180
Island Rules

00:13:44.660 --> 00:14:07.180
Today's

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:50.940
We fight for control of a single flag, and we win if we carry it back to our starting area within the time limit, right?

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:51.780
Exactly.

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:55.350
The little wharf where our ship is anchored will serve as our starting area.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.320
The beach our raft is shored at will be ours.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:03.530
When the flag carrier is hit, she exits the field without the flag.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.780
The game resumes with the flag wherever it was dropped.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.780
Sorry 'bout the flags, but that don't mean we'll go easy.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.170
Airsoft's fun even when ya lose,

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:15.290
but winning's a lot better, eh?

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.290
Well, we're not gonna lose!

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.780
<i>We won when we stormed the beach.</i>

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.290
<i>I want to keep winning!</i>

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.970
Our opponents are rather fast,

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.430
so I'm certain they'll reach the flag before us.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.370
But the flag is quite heavy,

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:38.440
so we should let them take it and focus on hitting them while they're burdened.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.800
Time is on our side.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:41.630
It is.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:45.720
That's why we should plan ahead and split into three groups.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:51.450
Karira and I will take center, Yachiyo and Rento the right flank, and Sono and Yura the left.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.600
Let's keep in contact.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.720
Okay.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.790
Karira will grab the flag when the time is right.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:58.930
Damn right I will.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.260
I want my swimsuit back!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.540
All right, everyone seems motivated.

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.760
Let's have fun!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.180
You ready over there?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.470
Yeah, let's go.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.380
Awright, let's go!

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.980
You're not gonna win this with speed!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.320
Later, alligator!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.530
Ambush, huh?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.250
Huh?

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.190
Wasn't that...

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.930
<i>There aren't two of them!</i>

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.190
<i>Only one enemy!</i>

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.210
Ya hit me.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.960
That makes one of them.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.540
I saw it!

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.990
I saw how she was mimicking two shooters!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:34.160
Yeah, but that could have been a trap too, so you should—

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:34.880
Hit.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.260
Let's back them up.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.230
Come on!

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:44.490
Sure.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.030
She's open!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.180
There are more than I thought.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:09.630
Four... No, all five of them?

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.630
<i>Go ahead and think there's an army of us.</i>

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:16.800
<i>We ain't just fast!</i>

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:20.720
Seto Stream Attack!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.190
We have to pull back and consolidate our front line!

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.030
Aoi is getting away!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.700
Should we join up with Yachiyo or Sono?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.940
Go to Yachiyo.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.560
I'll cover you.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.360
Roger!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.820
Stand still, dammit!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.130
How's it going?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:53.940
No luck.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.500
It's like Aoi's got three or four people backing her up.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.420
I'm pinned down here.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.760
What?

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.740
Just how fast are they?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.700
Seto Stream Attack Dash Turbo!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.440
Hit.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.810
<i>Wait for me, girls.</i>

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>I can do it!</i>

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.990
Wait, Yura!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:23.870
Pay more attention to—

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.300
I'm okay!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.370
I can do it!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.880
<i>She's not watching her surroundings.</i>

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.220
Yachiyo!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.240
Your barrel's peeking out!

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.400
Pull it back!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.160
Sorry.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:03.690
Yura!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.650
The enemies are dual wielding their guns!

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.250
They're trying to hide their actual numbers!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.250
I'll take care of them.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.750
Go to the flag, Kari!

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:14.250
But you...

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.270
I'll back you up.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.050
Don't worry.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:29.990
Hit.

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.490
Seto...

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.530
Stream Attack!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.330
Eat—

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.250
Hit.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.090
The flag's mine!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.600
The hell?

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.540
Ya hit me...

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.560
Go away!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.640
Go, Yura.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:15.400
Get the flag!

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.150
Okay!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.550
Wow.

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:03.860
Hurry!

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:21.000
I did it.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.870
You did it.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.640
Great job, Yura.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.680
Awesome, Yura!

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:30.320
It felt so natural...

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:34.120
It sure surprised me when you started giving orders.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.930
That was... on the spur of the moment.

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:37.420
Don't worry.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:38.580
You did great.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.780
We lost! Dagnabbit!

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:46.400
I want a rematch! A rematch!

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.860
Let's take a picture, everyone!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.330
Line up over here.

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:55.030
Hurry, Honoka.

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:11.160
Command!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.040
Control!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:15.290
Communication!

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.340
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:16.960
Yay!

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:20.170
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:23.510
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:28.640
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:30.730
Yay!

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:36.860
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:38.690
but that's fine

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:41.820
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:42.820
Ready?

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:45.320
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:48.370
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:52.080
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:55.170
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:56.080
All right?

00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:58.710
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:02.050
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:04.880
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:11.980
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.980 --> 00:23:13.690
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:14.230
Okay!

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:18.690
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:21.820
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:25.910
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

